        "action_en": "Obtain certified certified copies of revenue records (Khasra, Khatauni / B-1, P-II Kishtabandi, Jamabandi, Naksha/map) from the Tehsil or official land portal (e.g. Bhuiyan in CG / Bhulekh in UP) and check registration deed history.",
