        "section": "Section 161 (Compensation in Hit and Run Cases)",
        "plain_meaning": "Special scheme (Compensation to Victims of Hit and Run Motor Accidents Scheme, 2022) provides Rs. 2,00,000 in case of death and Rs. 50,000 for grievous hurt where the offending vehicle identity cannot be ascertained.",
