        "plain_meaning": "A bystander or Good Samaritan who assists an accident victim shall not be liable for any civil or criminal action for injury or death resulting from negligence in rendering emergency medical care, and cannot be forced to disclose identity or testify.",
        "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/1798"
